---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import MoreTools from '../components/content/MoreTools.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema, createWebPageSchema } from '../data/schemas';

const breadcrumb = breadcrumbSchema([
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy' },
]);

const lastUpdated = 'June 1, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Yes No Button"
  description="Privacy policy for the Yes No Button. We do not collect, store, or share any personal data. The tool runs entirely in your browser."
  canonical="https://yesnobuttonapp.com/privacy-policy"
  schema={[createWebPageSchema("Privacy policy for the Yes No Button. We do not collect, store, or share any personal data. The tool runs entirely in your browser.", 'https://yesnobuttonapp.com/privacy-policy'), breadcrumb]}
>
  <Fragment slot="header"><Header /></Fragment>

  <section class="py-[80px] max-sm:py-[48px] bg-[#FAFAF8] dark:bg-canvas-dark">
    <div class="container max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
        <a href="/about" class="text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-card-dark border border-border dark:border-border-dark text-muted dark:text-muted-dark hover:text-ink dark:hover:text-ink-dark transition-colors no-underline">About</a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-btn-bg dark:bg-btn-bg-dark text-btn-text dark:text-btn-text-dark border border-btn-bg dark:border-btn-bg-dark no-underline">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-card-dark border border-border dark:border-border-dark text-muted dark:text-muted-dark hover:text-ink dark:hover:text-ink-dark transition-colors no-underline">Terms</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-card-dark border border-border dark:border-border-dark text-muted dark:text-muted-dark hover:text-ink dark:hover:text-ink-dark transition-colors no-underline">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <span class="block text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.1em] text-[#16A34A] uppercase mb-2.5">PRIVACY POLICY</span>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[36px] max-sm:text-[28px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark leading-[1.15] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-muted-dark text-sm mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="text-muted dark:text-muted-dark space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Introduction</h2>
          <p>At YesNoButton ("we", "our", or "us"), we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website at yesnobuttonapp.com (the "Service").</p>
          <p>We believe in minimal data collection. The Yes No Button is designed to run entirely in your browser. We do not have servers that store your questions, answers, or personal information.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p><strong>We do not collect any personal data.</strong> The Yes No Button tool runs entirely client-side in your browser using JavaScript. When you press the button:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Your question is not sent to any server</li>
            <li>The result is generated locally in your browser</li>
            <li>No data is transmitted over the network</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">The only data that may be stored is your history of results in your browser's <code class="font-mono text-xs px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-border/30 dark:bg-border-dark/30 text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">localStorage</code>. This data never leaves your device and can be cleared at any time using the "Clear history" option in the tool.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Cookies and Tracking</h2>
          <p>We do not use cookies for tracking purposes. We may use essential cookies required for the basic functioning of the website (such as remembering your theme preference).</p>
          <p>We do not use analytics services that collect personal data. Any analytics we employ are privacy-focused and anonymized.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>Our website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process standard web server logs (IP addresses, browser type, pages requested) for security and performance purposes. These logs are retained for a limited period and are not used for user profiling.</p>
          <p>We do not integrate third-party advertising networks, social media tracking pixels, or any other data-collecting services.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Data Retention</h2>
          <p>Since we do not collect personal data, there is nothing to retain. Any data stored in your browser's localStorage is under your control and can be deleted at any time.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>The right to access any data we hold about you</li>
            <li>The right to request deletion of your data</li>
            <li>The right to withdraw consent</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">Since we do not collect or store personal data, exercising these rights is straightforward - there is nothing we hold.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Our Service is safe for children and complies with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) and similar regulations. We do not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13 (or the equivalent age in your jurisdiction).</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact" class="text-ink dark:text-ink-dark underline hover:no-underline">contact us</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <MoreTools />

  <Fragment slot="footer"><Footer /></Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
